msgid "CPU、原子操作与运行时装配契约"
msgstr "CPU, atomics and runtime assembly contracts"

msgid ""
"本契约适用于 M0、M0+、M3、M4、M7、M23、M33、M55、M85 的软件机制，以及 Native 模型。实现入口为 "
"[Arch](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/arch/README.md)，具体配置例子和整平台边界 见 [Cortex-M "
"支持说明](../delivery/cortex-m.md)。CPU 软件支持、具体芯片集成和 物理验收分别建立证据；增加 CPU profile "
"不增加 SoC、Board、外设或 HIL 资格。"
msgstr ""
"This contract covers software mechanisms for M0, M0+, M3, M4, M7, M23, M33, "
"M55 and M85, and the Native model. Implementation starts at "
"[Arch](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/arch/README.md); configuration examples and whole-platform boundaries"
" are in [Cortex-M support](../delivery/cortex-m.md). CPU software support, "
"chip integration and physical acceptance establish separate evidence; adding"
" a CPU profile adds no SoC, Board, peripheral or HIL qualification."

msgid "唯一事实与依赖方向"
msgstr "Single source of facts and dependency direction"

msgid ""
"`tools/configure/cpu.py` 校验显式 CPU/IRQ 事实，返回不可变 `CpuProfileIR`。 同一解析器服务完整 SoC"
" 装配与外部 CPU runtime 装配，派生编译选项、原子操作 后端、IRQ mask 类型和维护的 FreeRTOS "
"port。编译器宏用于验证所选指令集， 不能替代具体芯片的 DSP、可选 FPU、MVE、cache、MPU、DWT 或 SAU 事实。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/configure/cpu.py` validates explicit CPU/IRQ facts and returns "
"immutable `CpuProfileIR`. The same parser serves whole-SoC and external CPU-"
"runtime assembly, deriving compiler options, atomic backend, IRQ-mask types "
"and maintained FreeRTOS ports. Compiler macros validate the selected "
"instruction set; they cannot replace chip facts for DSP, optional FPU, MVE, "
"cache, MPU, DWT or SAU."

msgid ""
"完整平台由精确 SoC facts、Board 接线和一份外部 TOML 生成静态 typed factory。 CPU runtime 只读取一份 "
"`runtime.toml` 和它指向的 `cpu.json`，不生成厂商驱动、 链接脚本、向量表、启动、pin route、设备对象或 "
"factory。两种装配都禁止用 CMake cache、运行时寄存器探测或第二份默认配置覆盖已验证事实。"
msgstr ""
"A complete platform generates a static typed factory from exact SoC facts, "
"Board wiring and one external TOML. CPU runtime reads only one "
"`runtime.toml` and its referenced `cpu.json`; it generates no vendor driver,"
" linker script, vector table, startup, pin route, device object or factory. "
"Both assemblies forbid CMake cache, runtime register probing or a second "
"default configuration from overriding validated facts."

msgid ""
"Arch 不依赖 SoC、I/O、内核或厂商 SDK。Core 的 acquire/release publication 直接使用编译器 "
"load/store，不依赖 Arch；OS 与日志的 RMW 使用 Arch 原子端口， 可选 OS 使用 Arch "
"的合法上下文与掩码机制。产品提供任务、栈、TCB、缓冲区、内存 布局、保护策略和恢复责任。CPU runtime 的 `clock_hz` "
"是配置事实，不设置时钟， 也不生成可用于 request deadline 的单调时钟源。"
msgstr ""
"Arch depends on no SoC, I/O, kernel or vendor SDK. Core acquire/release "
"publication uses compiler load/store directly without Arch. OS and log RMW "
"use Arch atomic ports; optional OS uses Arch's valid-context and mask "
"mechanisms. Products supply tasks, stacks, TCBs, buffers, memory layout, "
"protection policy and recovery responsibility. CPU-runtime `clock_hz` is a "
"configuration fact; it neither sets clocks nor generates a monotonic source "
"for request deadlines."

msgid "CPU 局部互斥与上下文"
msgstr "CPU-local exclusion and context"

msgid ""
"`nx_arch_irq_save/restore` 保存并恢复输入 PRIMASK，token 只在同 CPU/线程内 "
"严格逆序使用一次。BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 在存在时保持原值。仅允许特权 Thread 或可配置 IRQ "
"使用该互斥域；NMI/HardFault 不被 PRIMASK 屏蔽，不得并发访问 其中的元数据。token 不是内核 critical-section"
" token，也不是跨核/跨安全域锁。 被屏蔽段只更新有界元数据，不调用内核、回调，不等待、分配或复制 payload。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_arch_irq_save/restore` saves and restores incoming PRIMASK; tokens are "
"single-use in strict reverse order on the same CPU/thread. BASEPRI/FAULTMASK"
" remain unchanged where present. Only privileged Thread or configurable IRQ "
"may participate in this exclusion domain. NMI/HardFault are not masked by "
"PRIMASK and must not concurrently access its metadata. Tokens are neither "
"kernel critical-section tokens nor cross-core/security-domain locks. Masked "
"sections update bounded metadata only, with no kernel calls, callbacks, "
"waiting, allocation or payload copies."

msgid ""
"`nx_arch_irq_masks` 是查询快照，不是 restore token。Baseline M0/M0+/M23 不读取不存在的 "
"BASEPRI/FAULTMASK。IPSR 身份、特权和安全状态分别查询：异常 号不等于 SoC IRQ ID，也不证明可以调用 FreeRTOS "
"ISR API。Handler mode 的 特权不能由被中断线程的 CONTROL.nPRIV 推断。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_arch_irq_masks` returns a query snapshot, not a restore token. Baseline "
"M0/M0+/M23 never read absent BASEPRI/FAULTMASK. IPSR identity, privilege and"
" security state are queried separately: exception numbers are not SoC IRQ "
"IDs and do not authorize FreeRTOS ISR APIs. Handler privilege cannot be "
"inferred from the interrupted thread's CONTROL.nPRIV."

msgid ""
"DMB、DSB、ISB 保留各自的排序语义，不证明 DMA 排空、外设 idle、缓存一致性或 request SETTLED。DWT "
"只读显式允许且已启用的特权周期计数器，不启用、不复位； 不可用时返回失败且保留输出。频率变化、暂停和 32-bit 回绕使它不能替代单调 "
"deadline 时钟。真实 IRQ latency、特权切换与周期上界仍需目标芯片测量。"
msgstr ""
"DMB, DSB and ISB preserve their own ordering semantics; they prove neither "
"DMA drain, peripheral idle, cache coherence nor request SETTLED. DWT reads "
"only an explicitly permitted, enabled privileged cycle counter and never "
"enables or resets it. Unavailability returns failure with outputs preserved."
" Frequency changes, pauses and 32-bit wrap prevent it from replacing "
"monotonic deadline time. Actual IRQ latency, privilege switching and cycle "
"bounds still need target-chip measurement."

msgid ""
"具体核的外部 IRQ 上限：M0/M0+ 为 32；M3/M4/M7/M23 为 240； M33/M55/M85 为 480。SoC 必须给出实际有效"
" vector 范围，不能以体系结构最大值 代替芯片事实。M0/M0+/M23 固定 2 个优先级位，Mainline 按事实声明 3～8 位。 "
"系统异常不计入外部 IRQ；CMSIS 寄存器数组容量不是处理器能力上限。 M33 的 DSP 是可选实现，必须声明 `dsp`；关闭时生成 "
"`+nodsp`，不能使用 编译器默认的 DSP 指令能力替代芯片事实。M4/M7/M55/M85 固定具备 DSP， M0/M0+/M3/M23 "
"没有该扩展；矛盾事实直接拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Architectural external-IRQ limits are 32 for M0/M0+, 240 for M3/M4/M7/M23, "
"and 480 for M33/M55/M85. SoCs must provide their actual valid vector range; "
"architectural maxima do not replace chip facts. M0/M0+/M23 use two priority "
"bits; Mainline declares 3–8 from facts. System exceptions do not count as "
"external IRQs, and CMSIS register-array capacity is not a processor "
"capability limit. M33 DSP is optional and requires explicit `dsp`; disabling"
" it generates `+nodsp`, without substituting compiler defaults for chip "
"facts. M4/M7/M55/M85 have DSP; M0/M0+/M3/M23 do not. Contradictory facts are"
" rejected."

msgid ""
"这些边界核对了 ARM 的 [M23 TRM](https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/static/63dbc7dc53e02459952dba53)、 [M33 "
"NVIC](https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/documentation/100230/0100/Introduction/Component-"
"blocks/Nested-Vectored-Interrupt-Controller)、 [M55 "
"NVIC](https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/documentation/101051/0101/Nested-Vectored-Interrupt-"
"Controller-/NVIC-features) 与 [M85 NVIC](https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/documentation/101924/0101/Nested-Vectored-Interrupt-"
"Controller-/NVIC-features)。 M7/M55/M85 的 cache line 为 32 "
"bytes，仍须显式声明芯片是否实现对应 cache。"
msgstr ""
"These boundaries were checked against ARM's [M23 TRM](https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/static/63dbc7dc53e02459952dba53), [M33 "
"NVIC](https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/documentation/100230/0100/Introduction/Component-"
"blocks/Nested-Vectored-Interrupt-Controller), [M55 "
"NVIC](https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/documentation/101051/0101/Nested-Vectored-Interrupt-"
"Controller-/NVIC-features) and [M85 NVIC](https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/documentation/101924/0101/Nested-Vectored-Interrupt-"
"Controller-/NVIC-features). M7/M55/M85 cache lines are 32 bytes; chip "
"implementation of each cache must still be explicitly declared."

msgid "32-bit publication 与 RMW"
msgstr "32-bit publication and RMW"

msgid ""
"`nexus/arch/atomic.h` 只操作仍然存活、自然对齐的 `uint32_t`。初始化发生在 发布前；所有并发访问使用这些 helper "
"或兼容的编译器原子操作，不能混入普通 读写。它不用于 MMIO，不保证 DMA 或其他 bus master 的原子性。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus/arch/atomic.h` operates only on live, naturally aligned `uint32_t` "
"objects. Initialization precedes publication; all concurrent accesses use "
"these helpers or compatible compiler atomics, never mixed plain "
"reads/writes. It is not for MMIO and guarantees no atomicity against DMA or "
"other bus masters."

msgid ""
"Acquire load/release store 在所有维护的 CPU 上使用编译器原子指令，不屏蔽 IRQ。成功 compare/exchange"
" 使用 acq_rel、失败使用 acquire；失败会更新调用者 私有 `expected`，不会伪造 spurious failure。fetch "
"add/sub 返回原值并按 32-bit 模数运算。发布状态与被发布 payload 的生命周期仍由 owner 负责。"
msgstr ""
"Acquire loads/release stores use compiler atomics on every maintained CPU "
"without masking IRQs. Successful compare/exchange is acq_rel, failure is "
"acquire; failure updates caller-private `expected` without inventing "
"spurious failure. Fetch add/sub returns the old value with 32-bit modular "
"arithmetic. Owners remain responsible for published-state and payload "
"lifetimes."

msgid ""
"M0/M0+ 的 RMW 使用固定范围的 saved-PRIMASK 读改写，再恢复输入 mask。 仅同 CPU 的特权 Thread/可配置 IRQ"
" 可并发参与；NMI、HardFault、非特权线程、 另一个核、DMA 或另一个安全域不能同时访问该存储。这是 CPU 局部机制，不宣称 lock-"
"free 或 bus atomic，也不静默链接 libatomic。其 masked 范围没有循环、 回调、分配、阻塞和 payload "
"copy；有界指令序列不等于已测得最坏 cycles。"
msgstr ""
"M0/M0+ RMW uses a fixed saved-PRIMASK read-modify-write span and restores "
"incoming masks. Only same-CPU privileged Thread/configurable IRQ may "
"participate concurrently; NMI, HardFault, unprivileged threads, other cores,"
" DMA and other security domains cannot access that storage concurrently. "
"This CPU-local mechanism claims neither lock-free nor bus-atomic operation "
"and never silently links libatomic. Its masked span has no loops, callbacks,"
" allocation, blocking or payload copy; a bounded instruction sequence is not"
" measured worst-case cycles."

msgid ""
"其他核使用编译器 lock-free word RMW。独占指令可能重试，lock-free 不等于固定 周期上界。M23 属于这一后端，不能依据它没有"
" BASEPRI 就归为 M0 的 RMW 后端。 停用对象前必须停止所有访问者；release/acquire 不自动回收 "
"request、通知或队列。"
msgstr ""
"Other cores use compiler lock-free word RMW. Exclusive instructions may "
"retry; lock-free does not mean a fixed cycle bound. M23 belongs to this "
"backend and must not be classified as M0 merely because it lacks BASEPRI. "
"All accessors must stop before deactivating an object; release/acquire does "
"not automatically reclaim requests, notifications or queues."

msgid "Cache 与指令同步"
msgstr "Cache and instruction synchronization"

msgid ""
"`cache.h` 区分 data clean、invalidate、clean-invalidate 和 instruction sync。 "
"能力来自精确 CPU facts，维护的 cache line 为 32 bytes；零表示没有该能力。 每次操作要求非零、完整 line "
"对齐的范围，地址/长度不得溢出 32-bit CPU 地址 空间，不向外取整。调用者独占每一整条 line，并排除其他 CPU、DMA 和安全域的 "
"访问，保持 cache 配置稳定。"
msgstr ""
"`cache.h` separates data clean, invalidate, clean-invalidate and instruction"
" sync. Capabilities come from exact CPU facts; maintained cache-line size is"
" 32 bytes and zero means absent capability. Every operation requires a "
"nonzero whole-line-aligned range, without address/length overflow beyond the"
" 32-bit CPU address space or outward rounding. Callers exclusively own each "
"complete line, exclude other CPUs, DMA and security domains, and keep cache "
"configuration stable."

msgid ""
"只允许特权 Thread/可配置 IRQ；操作不自动屏蔽 IRQ、不启用 cache。存在但关闭 的 cache 返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED。instruction sync 在任何维护写入前检查全部相关 cache，调用者还须阻止该范围的执行。函数不 flush 无关"
" dirty line、不验证代码， 也不进行全局 branch-predictor 维护。"
msgstr ""
"Only privileged Thread/configurable IRQ is permitted; operations neither "
"automatically mask IRQs nor enable cache. Present but disabled cache returns"
" UNSUPPORTED. Instruction sync checks all relevant caches before any "
"maintenance write, and callers must also prevent execution from the range. "
"Functions neither flush unrelated dirty lines, validate code nor perform "
"global branch-predictor maintenance."

msgid ""
"Invalidate 可以丢弃 dirty data，调用者明确承担这一后果。DMA receive 的前置和 排空后的维护由具体 "
"provider/产品协调；cache 操作本身不证明 DMA idle，也不 结束 request/buffer 借用。工作量随 complete "
"line 数量增加，不能笼统称为 O(1)。"
msgstr ""
"Invalidate may discard dirty data; callers explicitly accept that "
"consequence. DMA-receive maintenance before start and after drain is "
"coordinated by the provider/product. Cache operations themselves neither "
"prove DMA idle nor end request/buffer borrows. Work increases with complete-"
"line count and cannot be broadly called O(1)."

msgid ""
"`cache_control.h` 单独提供 reviewed M7 的冷 Cache 启停；其他 CPU profile 明确返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED，不能从范围维护能力推断全局启停支持。调用者提供零初始化、 独占且不复制的控制对象，要求特权 "
"Thread、PRIMASK=1、BASEPRI/FAULTMASK=0， 并排除 DMA、NMI/HardFault "
"和其他使用相关内存的执行者。可信复位或此前成功完成 自有 clean/disable 才能建立已知干净的冷状态；CCR 位为零不证明外来 dirty "
"line 不存在，不允许认领未知 bootloader 状态。内存属性、执行与一致性政策属于调用者。"
msgstr ""
"`cache_control.h` separately provides reviewed M7 cold-cache enable/disable;"
" other CPU profiles explicitly return UNSUPPORTED. Range-maintenance "
"capability does not imply global cache-control support. Callers provide "
"zero-initialized, exclusive, noncopied control objects and require "
"privileged Thread, PRIMASK=1, BASEPRI/FAULTMASK=0, excluding DMA, "
"NMI/HardFault and other executors using relevant memory. Only trusted reset "
"or a previously successful owned clean/disable establishes known-clean cold "
"state; zero CCR bits do not prove absence of foreign dirty lines or "
"authorize claiming unknown bootloader state. Memory attributes, execution "
"and coherence policy belong to callers."

msgid ""
"实现先核对 M7 身份和维护的实际 set/way 几何，再取得所选 I/D Cache 责任， 保存并恢复 "
"CSSELR；失败读回不能报告成功。部分失败保留 owned mask 或 selector 恢复责任，必须保留同一对象并重试 "
"disable，不能根据当前 CCR 重新认领外来状态。 disable 只在所有 provider/DMA 排空后执行；D-cache 全 "
"set/way clean 到 CCR 关闭使用无 stack/call 的 leaf，并保留 DSB/ISB，避免最后 clean 后重新产生局部 "
"dirty line。工作量随实际 set 数量增加，不承诺固定延迟。该机制不改变输入 mask， 不自动发现设备或分配存储，也不建立 DMA "
"一致性的完整系统合同。"
msgstr ""
"Implementation checks M7 identity and actual maintained set/way geometry "
"before taking responsibility for selected I/D caches, saving/restoring "
"CSSELR. Failed readback cannot report success. Partial failure retains "
"owned-mask or selector-restoration responsibility; the same object must "
"remain for disable retries rather than reclaiming foreign state from current"
" CCR. Disable runs only after all providers/DMA drain. The all-set/way "
"D-cache clean through CCR disable uses a stack/call-free leaf with DSB/ISB "
"so final clean cannot create local dirty lines afterward. Work grows with "
"actual set count; fixed latency is not promised. The mechanism preserves "
"incoming masks, discovers no devices, allocates no storage and establishes "
"no complete system DMA-coherence contract."

msgid "MPU 编码与单区域编程"
msgstr "MPU encoding and single-region programming"

msgid ""
"`mpu.h` 保留独立 v7 size/subregion 格式与 v8 base/limit/MAIR 格式。纯 encoder 在任意 "
"profile 上可用，拒绝非法或保留编码、错位和不完整边界，不截断/取整， 失败保留输出。输入和输出不能重叠。编码不证明 SoC 可达性、DMA "
"coherency 或 产品权限正确性。M0+ 的可选 MPU 属于 ARMv6 PMSA，使用兼容 RBAR/RASR 格式； 这不改变其 "
"ARMv6-M 指令架构。M0 不提供 MPU 编程能力。"
msgstr ""
"`mpu.h` keeps separate v7 size/subregion and v8 base/limit/MAIR formats. "
"Pure encoders are available on any profile and reject invalid/reserved "
"encodings, misalignment and incomplete boundaries without "
"truncation/rounding; failures preserve outputs. Inputs and outputs must not "
"overlap. Encoding proves neither SoC reachability, DMA coherence nor "
"product-permission correctness. Optional M0+ MPU is ARMv6 PMSA with "
"compatible RBAR/RASR format; this does not change its ARMv6-M instruction "
"architecture. M0 provides no MPU programming capability."

msgid ""
"实际 region programming 要求本安全域内特权 Thread、输入 PRIMASK=1、MPU 已经 disabled，并由调用者独占 "
"selector 和对应状态。实现先校验 profile、字段、 实际 TYPE region 数量与上下文，再写所选区域；保留 CTRL 和输入 "
"RNR，不自动 启用、不 clear 所有 region，不访问另一个世界的 alias。Handler 或 enabled MPU "
"调用被拒绝，不通过自动关 MPU 改变保护策略。"
msgstr ""
"Actual region programming requires privileged Thread within this security "
"domain, incoming PRIMASK=1, an already disabled MPU, and caller-exclusive "
"selector/state ownership. Implementation validates profile, fields, actual "
"TYPE region count and context before writing the selected region. It "
"preserves CTRL and incoming RNR, does not enable or clear every region, and "
"accesses no other-world aliases. Handler or enabled-MPU calls are rejected "
"without automatically disabling protection policy."

msgid ""
"v8 MAIR 更新只改变指定 byte，保留相邻属性。调用者拥有使用该 attribute 的 所有 region 与有效内存策略；实现不做 "
"cache 维护。MPU 的后续 enable、重配和 上下文切换属于 Arch 层之外的 OS 或产品集成责任。平台已有明确范围的 [FreeRTOS"
" MPU 用户任务集成](os-contracts.md)，其 CPU、 任务、存储和系统调用边界由 OS 合同维护；不能只依据 Arch "
"encoder 或单 region programming 推导这些能力，也不能扩大到未维护组合。"
msgstr ""
"v8 MAIR updates only the selected byte and preserves neighboring attributes."
" The caller owns all regions using that attribute and their effective memory"
" policy; implementation performs no cache maintenance. Later MPU enable, "
"reconfiguration and context switching belong to OS or product integration "
"outside Arch. The platform maintains explicitly scoped [FreeRTOS MPU user-"
"task integration](os-contracts.md); the OS contract defines its CPU, task, "
"storage and syscall boundaries. These capabilities cannot be inferred solely"
" from an Arch encoder or single-region programming, or extended to "
"unmaintained combinations."

msgid "安全状态与 SAU"
msgstr "Security state and SAU"

msgid ""
"`security.h` 查询此 image 的显式 single/Secure/NonSecure 状态。查询不授权 跨世界访问，也不探测或推断真实 "
"SoC IDAU policy。SAU encoder 验证精确的 32-byte base/inclusive-limit 与 NSC "
"标志，失败保留输出。"
msgstr ""
"`security.h` queries this image's explicit single/Secure/NonSecure state. "
"Queries neither authorize cross-world access nor probe/infer real SoC IDAU "
"policy. The SAU encoder validates exact 32-byte base/inclusive-limit and NSC"
" flags, preserving outputs on failure."

msgid ""
"只有明确 Secure 编译与事实声明了 SAU 的 image 可以进行 SAU MMIO。写/清单个 region 要求 Secure 特权 "
"Thread、输入 PRIMASK=1、SAU disabled 和独占 ownership； 实际 TYPE region 数量在写入前校验。保留 "
"CTRL、ALLNS、输入 RNR 和其他区域， 不 enable SAU，不使用跨世界寄存器。NonSecure/single image 不写 "
"SAU MMIO。"
msgstr ""
"Only images explicitly compiled Secure with SAU declared in facts may "
"perform SAU MMIO. Writing/clearing one region requires Secure privileged "
"Thread, incoming PRIMASK=1, disabled SAU and exclusive ownership; actual "
"TYPE region count is checked before writes. CTRL, ALLNS, incoming RNR and "
"other regions are preserved; SAU is not enabled and no cross-world registers"
" are used. NonSecure/single images write no SAU MMIO."

msgid ""
"IDAU、重叠规则、Secure boot、NSC veneers、双世界 gateway、共享资源协议、密钥 和安全升级由产品/具体 SoC "
"接入承担。Secure-only 或 standalone NonSecure FreeRTOS kernel 编译不代表已支持成对世界 "
"context、Secure task gateway 或用户 MPU task 隔离。这些项目没有本轮物理验收证据。"
msgstr ""
"IDAU, overlap rules, Secure boot, NSC veneers, dual-world gateways, shared-"
"resource protocols, keys and secure updates belong to products/chip "
"integration. Compiling Secure-only or standalone NonSecure FreeRTOS kernels "
"does not establish paired-world contexts, Secure-task gateways or user MPU-"
"task isolation. These features have no physical acceptance evidence in this "
"iteration."

msgid "NonSecure 内存权限观察"
msgstr "Observing NonSecure memory permissions"

msgid ""
"`nonsecure.h` 只在 Secure 特权 Thread 中观察完整跨度的 NonSecure 非特权 read 或 read/write "
"权限，使用真实 CMSE 指令并同时检查安全归属和 NS MPU。 检查不解引用指针；拒绝空指针、零长度、地址溢出和非法 access，相邻合法区域 "
"也可能被保守拒绝。Native、single-state 和 NonSecure image 返回 UNSUPPORTED。 该机制不要求存在可编程 "
"SAU；固定 IDAU 也可以建立供检查的归属。"
msgstr ""
"`nonsecure.h` observes NonSecure unprivileged read or read/write permission "
"over a complete span only from Secure privileged Thread, using actual CMSE "
"instructions and checking security attribution plus NS MPU. It does not "
"dereference pointers and rejects null pointers, zero lengths, address "
"overflow and invalid access; adjacent valid regions may be conservatively "
"rejected. Native, single-state and NonSecure images return UNSUPPORTED. "
"Programmable SAU is not required; fixed IDAU may establish attribution for "
"observation."

msgid ""
"成功只是当时的权限观察，不 pin/copy/borrow，不鉴别 gateway 调用者，不证明 RAM、DMA "
"可达性、对象生命周期、总线防火墙或实际访问不会 fault，也不屏蔽 中断或冻结另一世界。集成者必须排除 MMIO、阻止归属和映射变化，并单独复制输入 "
"快照、在不可逆效果前验证输出。U575 的独立同步双域参考显式提供这些 owner 前提；它不是任意用户地址空间、异步 DMA 或 NS RTOS "
"的通用 transport。具体 边界见 [U575 双域合同](u575-trustzone-contract.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Success is only a permission observation at that moment: no pin/copy/borrow,"
" gateway-caller authentication, proof of RAM, DMA reachability, object "
"lifetime, bus firewalls or fault-free actual access; interrupts are not "
"masked and the other world is not frozen. Integrators must exclude MMIO, "
"prevent attribution/mapping changes, separately copy input snapshots and "
"validate outputs before irreversible effects. The independent U575 "
"synchronous dual-world reference explicitly supplies these owner "
"prerequisites; it is not a generic transport for arbitrary user address "
"spaces, asynchronous DMA or NS RTOS. See [U575 dual-world "
"contract](u575-trustzone-contract.md) for exact boundaries."

msgid "验证与可支持性"
msgstr "Verification and supportability"

msgid ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 在窄指令/MMIO 边界替换硬件，运行生产 C 算法，覆盖非法 "
"字段/上下文在状态变更前拒绝、selector/mask 保存恢复和各可选能力组合。Native 运行真实递归线程互斥、C11 fence 与 "
"publication/生命周期行为；Native cache/MPU/ SAU MMIO 返回 absent-hardware 结果，纯 "
"encoder 仍可使用。模型不执行真实 NVIC。"
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock replace hardware at narrow instruction/MMIO boundaries"
" while running production C algorithms, covering invalid field/context "
"rejection before mutation, selector/mask preservation and optional-"
"capability combinations. Native runs real recursive thread exclusion, C11 "
"fences and publication/lifecycle behavior. Native cache/MPU/SAU MMIO returns"
" absent-hardware results while pure encoders remain usable. Models do not "
"execute real NVIC."

msgid ""
"锁定 ARM 编译器门禁分别验证九核的宏、ABI、对象、指令和未解析符号，再编译 所选 Core/Arch/OS kernel "
"组合。FPU/MVE/security 的可选组合按事实单独执行，不 从一种组合继承到所有组合。每次记录真实命令、返回码、工具身份与输出 hash。"
msgstr ""
"Locked ARM compiler gates independently validate macros, ABI, objects, "
"instructions and unresolved symbols across nine cores, then compile selected"
" Core/Arch/OS kernel combinations. Optional FPU/MVE/security combinations "
"execute separately from facts and do not inherit results from one "
"combination. Every run records actual commands, return codes, tool "
"identities and output hashes."

msgid ""
"本轮执行证据由当前源码重新生成；正式 clean-source SDK、离线双构建和 candidate 封存还须遵循 "
"[qualification](../delivery/qualification.md)。旧 HEAD 的通过数、 candidate "
"或硬件状态不能继承。F407/F470 三板维护首发模式，G474/H743/U575 参考装配另行维护具体 startup、timebase、GPIO"
" 和 IRQ UART；G474 增加 selected EXTI，H743 增加固定 Cache 配置和有限 TX DMA，U575 另有独立无 OS"
" 的同步双域 参考。它们不由 CPU profile 自动生成，也不建立 DMA/cache/security 全功能支持。 M7 冷 Cache "
"另有真实 leaf 指令门禁，U575 双域另有实际 SG／BLXNS、双 ELF 地址和 LOAD "
"映射门禁；这些结果仍不能证明芯片物理隔离或一致性。全部实板 HIL 未执行。软件模型或成功编译不提升产品 release。"
msgstr ""
"This iteration regenerates execution evidence from current sources; formal "
"clean-source SDK, offline dual builds and candidate sealing still follow "
"[qualification](../delivery/qualification.md). Old-HEAD pass counts, "
"candidates or hardware status cannot be inherited. F407/F470 three-board "
"launch modes remain maintained; G474/H743/U575 reference assemblies "
"separately maintain startup, timebase, GPIO and IRQ UART. G474 adds selected"
" EXTI, H743 fixed-cache configurations and finite TX DMA, and U575 an "
"independent OS-free synchronous dual-world reference. CPU profiles neither "
"generate them nor establish full DMA/cache/security support. M7 cold-cache "
"has actual leaf-instruction gates; U575 dual-world has actual SG／BLXNS, "
"dual-ELF address and LOAD-map gates, yet these cannot prove physical "
"isolation or coherence. All physical HIL remains unexecuted. Software models"
" or successful compilation do not promote a product release."
